    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Save Retrieval API allows users to access previously saved shopping cart data, enabling a seamless shopping experience. Developers can utilize this endpoint to fetch saved carts for customers, facilitating features such as cart restoration or user-specific recommendations. Typical consumers include e-commerce platforms and retail applications looking to enhance user engagement by allowing customers to retrieve their saved carts. This API ensures that businesses can improve conversion rates by making it easy for customers to resume their shopping journeys.",
